@startuml 07_diagrama_casos_de_uso
title REBA — Diagrama de casos de uso

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Operador\n«usuario dashboard»" as op
actor "Técnico\n«config/soporte»" as tech
actor "Nodo ESP32-CAM\n«sistema edge»" as esp
actor "Ingeniero IA\n«offline»" as eng

rectangle "Sistema REBA" {

  ' ---- Actor: Operador ----
  usecase "UC-01 Ver captura en vivo\n«última foto + clases + conf»" as uc01
  usecase "UC-02 Consultar analítica\n«KPIs · donut · actividad 7/14/30d · galería»" as uc02
  usecase "UC-03 Gestionar dispositivo\n«WiFi, server_url, bomba, distancias»" as uc03
  usecase "UC-04 Activar bomba manual\n«segundos 1-300 + 'Activar ahora'»" as uc04
  usecase "UC-05 Exportar dataset YOLO\n«ZIP images+labels+data.yaml»" as uc05
  usecase "UC-06 Ver historial bomba\n«pump_events + pending_cmd»" as uc06
  usecase "UC-07 Consultar salud sistema\n«device.online, inference, contadores»" as uc07
  usecase "UC-08 Ver telemetría/perf\n«circuito + /api/perf»" as uc08
  usecase "UC-09 Reset de datos\n«DELETE /api/captures?scope=»" as uc09
  usecase "UC-19 Cambiar tema\n«claro/oscuro, localStorage»" as uc19

  ' ---- Actor: ESP32 (sistema) ----
  usecase "UC-10 Detectar objeto\n«HC-SR04 0-23 cm, debounce 2/3»" as uc10
  usecase "UC-11 Capturar foto\n«flash 150ms + JPEG QVGA»" as uc11
  usecase "UC-12 Subir foto al server\n«POST /upload, cola, retry 15s»" as uc12
  usecase "UC-13 Descargar config remota\n«GET /api/device/config c/60s»" as uc13
  usecase "UC-14 Ejecutar bomba\n«auto: N fotos · manual: pump_cmd»" as uc14
  usecase "UC-15 Confirmar comando\n«POST /api/device/ack»" as uc15
  usecase "UC-16 Reportar telemetría\n«POST /api/device/status»" as uc16
  usecase "UC-17 Auto-actualizar OTA\n«ota_url → /firmware.bin → reboot»" as uc17
  usecase "UC-18 Conmutar servidor\n«failover srv_pri↔srv_alt»" as uc18

  ' ---- Actor: Ingeniero IA ----
  usecase "UC-20 Generar/curar datasets\n«sintético, TACO, EcoSort»" as uc20
  usecase "UC-21 Entrenar y exportar ONNX\n«train_outdoor.py → best.onnx»" as uc21
  usecase "UC-22 Evaluar modelo\n«offline + eval_upload_path + tune_conf»" as uc22

  ' ---- Relaciones operador ----
  op --> uc01
  op --> uc02
  op --> uc03
  op --> uc04
  op --> uc05
  op --> uc06
  op --> uc07
  op --> uc08
  op --> uc09
  op --> uc19

  ' ---- Relaciones ESP32 ----
  esp --> uc10
  uc10 ..> uc11 : <<include>>
  uc11 ..> uc12 : <<include>>
  uc12 ..> uc13 : <<extend>> «mismo canal HTTP»
  uc12 ..> uc14 : <<include>> «cada pump_photos fotos'
  uc14 ..> uc15 : <<include>> «tras pump_cmd manual'
  esp --> uc15
  uc13 ..> uc16 : <<include>> «tras poll OK»
  uc13 ..> uc17 : <<extend>> «si llega ota_url»
  uc13 ..> uc18 : <<extend>> «si 3 polls fallan»

  ' ---- Relaciones técnico ----
  tech --> uc03 : «alta privilegio: mismas vías»
  tech --> uc13 : «portal REBA-Setup / serie SET»

  ' ---- Relaciones IA ----
  eng --> uc20
  uc20 ..> uc21 : <<include>>
  uc21 ..> uc22 : <<include>>
  uc22 ..> uc05 : <<extend>> «export YOLO = dataset real»

  ' ---- Internas del sistema (no actor) ----
  usecase "UC-30 Clasificar foto\n«ONNX YOLOv8 → 3 clases»" as uc30
  usecase "UC-31 Persistir evidencia\n«doble JPEG + detections»" as uc31
  usecase "UC-32 Notificar dashboard\n«WS capture/detections»" as uc32
  usecase "UC-33 Poda retención\n«CAPTURE_RETENTION horaria»" as uc33
  uc12 ..> uc30 : <<include>>
  uc30 ..> uc31 : <<include>>
  uc31 ..> uc32 : <<include>>
  uc33 ..> uc31 : <<extend>>
}

note bottom of uc04
  Bomba manual: el server NO acciona hardware directo —
  encola pump_cmd (<unix_ts>:<s>, TTL 10 min) que el ESP32
  recoge en su poll, ejecuta no-bloqueante y confirma por ack.
end note

note bottom of uc13
  Tres vías de configuración sin reflashear:
  dashboard → admin/device-config · portal REBA-Setup · serie SET.
  Cambios WiFi/URL llevan backup + reversión automática.
  server_url_alt = túnel Cloudflare (failover automático).
end note

@enduml
